{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03599","headline":"和麴典设扈从东郊忆弟使往安西冬至日恨不得同申拜庆 · 李峤","name":"和麴典设扈从东郊忆弟使往安西冬至日恨不得同申拜庆","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉关方叱驭，桂苑正陪舆。\n桓岭嗟分翼，姜川限馈鱼。\n雪花含□晚，云叶带荆舒。\n重此西流咏，弥伤南至初。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李峤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03599.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03599","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}